    rdfs:label "] \\& (-,music) tikzcd% Entry as representable: the entry functor is naturally isomorphic to its representable.fig:music-entry-as-representable theorem[Entry is representable] thm:music-entry-is-representable The Music entry functor is representable; its representing object is \\(music\\). theorem proof Step 1 (functor). The entry has a functor. Step 2 (representing object). \\(music\\) is the representing object. Step 3 (isomorphism). The natural isomorphism is the Yoneda isomorphism. Step 4 (no other representing object). The representing object is unique up to isomorphism. proof example[worked: \\(music\\) as the engine apex representing object] ex:music-representing-object The representing object \\(music\\) is the Music engine apex, which by chapter 04 §1 is the colimit of the project- position cocone: provenance leg (git history under Music/), time-window leg (round-3 swarm interval), authorship leg (the per-paper agent operating under SHA-pinned contracts), title leg (directory name" .
